    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Welcome to the DRL SIm Flight School Module.\r\n\r\nThis module has been designed for those who aspire to be serious pilots. Unlike our Training module, this program is almost completely done in Pro Mode (Acro) and mostly in First Person View (FPV). \r\n\r\nCompleting this module in its entirety will certify you as a Pro Level pilot. Qualifying you for future tournaments and other events that might take place.\r\n\r\nPress Next to proceed to the Diagnostic Test, this test will measure your current skill and place you in the appropriate level.\r\n\n"
